build/bin
node_modules
frontend/dist
# Stray top-level Go build artifacts (e.g. a bare `go build` run from desktop/
# without -o build/bin/...) -- one such binary (desktop.exe, ~400MB) was
# accidentally committed once and had to be stripped from history to unblock
# a push past GitHub's 100MB file limit.
/desktop.exe
/desktop

# Frozen sidecar bundles staged by scripts/build_sidecar.py -- rebuilt by
# wails.json's preBuildHooks on every `wails build`. PLACEHOLDER.md is the
# one file in sidecar_dist/ that stays tracked (go:embed needs a match even
# when no frozen bundle exists yet, see that file).
sidecar_dist/*/

# Bundled SUAVE runtime staged by scripts/build_suave_env.py -- same rebuild-
# every-`wails build`/checked-in-PLACEHOLDER.md pattern as sidecar_dist/ above.
suave_dist/*/
